  m_Text: "\u2022 WASD / Ok Tu\u015Flar\u0131: Karakter Hareketi & Ko\u015Fma\n\u2022
    Fare \u0130mleci: Y\xF6nelme ve Ni\u015Fan Alma\n\u2022 Sol T\u0131k / [E]: Siklon
    Vakum Ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131 (Kum Toplama)\n\u2022 Sa\u011F T\u0131k: Silika
    Kristal T\xFCfe\u011Fi (D\xFC\u015Fman & Vent Sald\u0131r\u0131s\u0131)\n\u2022
    Space: Sismik \u015Eok Dalgas\u0131 (AoE Kum Temizleme & \u0130tme)\n\u2022 [Q]:
    G\xFCne\u015F Plazma M\u0131zra\u011F\u0131 (Delici I\u015F\u0131n Sald\u0131r\u0131s\u0131)\n\u2022
    [R]: Toz Tank\u0131n\u0131 Ar\u0131t (At\xF6lye/Merkezde bonuslu Silika)\n\u2022
    [F]: At\xF6lye A\xE7 / Kapat (Eco-Hub [18, 14] Yan\u0131nda)\n\u2022 [T]: Ye\u015Fil
    Ku\u015Fak Vaha A\u011Fac\u0131 Dik (\U0001F48E 8 Silika)\n\u2022 ESC: Duraklat
    / Pencereleri Kapat"
